    "44": "relieve the torment, he",
    "45": "agreed to become our Key",
    "46": "Master, bound to watch the",
    "47": "Guardian's cave to ensure the",
    "48": "Guardian does not break loose",
    "49": "again.",
    "50": "",
    "51": "He has served well over the",
    "52": "years. It was cruel of the",
    "53": "Elders to subject him to such",
    "54": "a fate, but the need was",
    "55": "desperate.",
    "56": "",
    "57": "The Soul Altar",
    "58": "",
