    "62": "Kourend, bringing their souls",
    "63": "to the safety of the River.",
    "64": "We cannot know the fate of",
    "65": "souls in distant lands beyond",
    "66": "the reach of our soul altar,",
    "67": "but the destiny provided by",
    "68": "our soul altar is a sure",
    "69": "comfort to us here.",
    "70": "",
    "71": "We therefore owe a debt of",
    "72": "gratitude to the Dark Altar,",
    "73": "for it is the Dark Altar's",
    "74": "power that creates and"
  },
  {
