    "53": "souls of our forebears would",
    "54": "be abandoned to an unknown",
    "55": "fate.",
    "56": "",
    "57": "It is not known why the Dark",
    "58": "Altar has created our soul",
    "60": "altar or blood altar; cynical",
    "61": "minds have speculated that",
